ith actionState, availabilityLabel, capacityLabel, myBookingId), Booking, BookingChange, MyBookings, Stats, PromotionNotices and SimulationResult. The Error code enum is already_booked, class_full, not_full, outside_booking_window, class_has_started, cancelled_by_studio, overlap, limit_reached, invalid_booking_state, undo_expired, not_found, invalid_request and storage_failure. The error's session field is a refreshed session, sent with class_full."},{"anchors":[{"lineEnd":8,"lineStart":6,"path":"App.Api/App.Api.csproj","quote":"    <!-- the build writes the API's OpenAPI document here; the factory compares it with contracts/openapi.yaml -->\n    <OpenApiDocumentsDirectory>$(MSBuildProjectDirectory)/openapi</OpenApiDocumentsDirectory>\n    <OpenApiGenerateDocumentsOptions>--file-name built</OpenApiGenerateDocumentsOptions>","symbol":"App.Api.csproj"},{"lineEnd":6,"lineStart":5,"path":"App.Api/Program.cs","quote":"builder.Services.AddOpenApi();\n// a local file database; nothing touches it at startup (the build runs this file to write the API's OpenAPI document)","symbol":"Program"}],"id":"C-4","spans":["I-1"],"text":"The build checks contract conformance: it writes the generated OpenAPI document to App.Api/openapi (file name 'built'), and the factory compares it with contracts/openapi.yaml. AddOpenApi() is registered in Program.cs. The startup comment says nothing touches the database at startup, because the build runs Program.cs to generate the document."},{"anchors":[{"lineEnd":7,"lineStart":7,"path":"App.Api/Program.cs","quote":"builder.Services.AddDbContext<AppDb>(o => o.UseSqlite(builder.Configuration.GetConnectionString(\"App\") ?? \"Data Source=app.db\"));","symbol":"Program"},{"lineEnd":7,"lineStart":5,"path":"App.Api/AppDb.cs","quote":"public class AppDb(DbContextOptions<AppDb> options) : DbContext(options)\n{\n}","symbol":"AppDb"},{"lineEnd":15,"lineStart":15,"path":"App.Api/App.Api.csproj","quote":"    <PackageReference Include=\"Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore.Sqlite\" Version=\"9.0.0\" />","symbol":"App.Api.csproj"}],"id":"C-5","spans":["I-2"],"text":"SQLite is wired up but holds nothing. AppDb is registered with UseSqlite, using connection string 'App' or the default 'Data Source=app.db'. The EF Core Sqlite 9.0.0 package is referenced. AppDb is an empty DbContext with no DbSets, entity configuration or seed data (HasData), and nothing calls EnsureCreated or migrations. No search turned up any seed code, migrations or connection-string config."},{"anchors":[{"lineEnd":286,"lineStart":285,"path":"contracts/openapi.yaml","quote":"        \"409\":\n          description: Rejected by a booking rule (already_booked, class_full, outside_booking_window, class_has_started, cancelled_by_studio, overlap, limit_reached)","symbol":"createBooking"},{"lineEnd":301,"lineStart":301,"path":"contracts/openapi.yaml","quote":"      summary: Undo a booking within 5 seconds, as if it was never made","symbol":"undoBooking"},{"lineEnd":351,"lineStart":351,"path":"contracts/openapi.yaml","quote":"      summary: Cancel a Booked record (late flag when under 2 hours to start)","symbol":"cancelBooking"},{"lineEnd":446,"lineStart":445,"path":"contracts/openapi.yaml","quote":"        \"409\":\n          description: Rejected (already_booked, not_full, outside_booking_window, class_has_started, cancelled_by_studio)","symbol":"joinWaitlist"},{"lineEnd":461,"lineStart":461,"path":"contracts/openapi.yaml","quote":"      summary: Leave a waitlist (stored as Cancelled, not late)","symbol":"leaveWaitlist"},{"lineEnd":806,"lineStart":803,"path":"contracts/openapi.yaml","quote":"        reason:\n          type: string\n          nullable: true\n          description: Disabled reason, e.g. Class has started, Cancelled by studio, Booking opens 7 days before class, Booking closes 15 minutes before class","symbol":"ActionState"}],"id":"C-6","spans":["I-3"],"text":"No business rules are implemented anywhere in the code. The contract is the only place that states them: createBooking returns 409 for already_booked, class_full, outside_booking_window, class_has_started, cancelled_by_studio, overlap and limit_reached. joinWaitlist returns 409 for already_booked, not_full, outside_booking_window, class_has_started and cancelled_by_studio. Undo is only allowed within 5 seconds (undo_expired). Cancel sets a late flag when under 2 hours to start. Leaving a waitlist is stored as Cancelled, not late. The disabled reasons give the booking window: opens 7 days before class, closes 15 minutes before. The contract names limit_reached but never gives the number for the limit."},{"anchors":[{"lineEnd":657,"lineStart":657,"path":"contracts/openapi.yaml","quote":"      summary: Test-only hook that simulates another member cancelling and promotes the waitlist (no UI)","symbol":"simulateOtherMemberCancellation"},{"lineEnd":17,"lineStart":13,"path":"App.Tests/HealthTests.cs","quote":"    public async Task ApiIsUp()\n    {\n        var res = await _factory.CreateClient().GetAsync(\"/\");\n        Assert.Equal(HttpStatusCode.OK, res.StatusCode);\n    }","symbol":"HealthTests.ApiIsUp"}],"id":"C-7","spans":["I-3","I-1"],"text":"Waitlist promotion has no implementation. The contract only describes it: a test-only hook simulates another member cancelling and promotes the waitlist, and promotion notices are listed until they are acknowledged (shown as a toast once). The only existing test checks that GET / returns 200."}],"header":{"createdAt":"2026-10-06T23:40:15.969Z","inputsHash":"","kind":"current-behaviour","producedBy":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","stage":"ground"},"runId":"20261006-boutique-fitness-studio-class-31fe","schemaVersion":1},"notFound":[{"searched":["seed","HasData","EnsureCreated","Migrat","ConnectionStrings","Booking|Session|Member in **/*.cs/json"],"span":"I-2"},{"searched":["waitlist|capacity|overlap|limit|window in **/*.cs,md,json,txt","Booking|Session|Member in code files"],"span":"I-3"}]}